This repository is a throughline *source*: a requirements graph, not a program. It
re-expresses the OWASP Application Security Verification Standard (ASVS) as a grounded IDD
graph so consuming projects can compose it with throughline.

The ASVS requirement text reproduced here (items' `text`/`attrs.source_ref`) is taken from:

  - OWASP Application Security Verification Standard (ASVS) — https://github.com/OWASP/ASVS

