ASVS-derived content in this repository is likewise made available under CC BY-SA 4.0,
with attribution to the OWASP Foundation.

Changes: the ASVS has been restructured as a throughline graph. Each requirement is a
separate item with a UID of this repository's own, grouped under the ASVS's chapters and
linked to them; the published ASVS reference of each requirement is kept in
`attrs.source_ref`. Any change to the wording of a requirement is recorded in this
repository's history.

